<br><p>

<a href="http://www.geocities.com/Broadway/1928/pykrete.htm">Shooting at pykrete</a>
<br>
Eccentric Lives And Peculiar Notions<br>

Practical joke: while it's snowing, blow some wood flour continuously onto
the snow.  (Hmmm, does wheat flour work?)  As it piles up, it will form
Pykrete.  That pile of "snow" might still be in your yard in august!

<br><p>

